é a esta tierra; porque no te dejaré hasta tanto que haya hecho lo que te he dicho.", "words": [[0, 140891], [2, 141051], [5, 141151], [11, 141491], [14, 141771], [18, 142031], [27, 142731], [29, 143011], [32, 143151], [41, 143651], [45, 143831], [51, 144031], [58, 144411], [62, 144571], [69, 145111], [71, 145391], [74, 145511], [82, 145971], [84, 146071], [89, 146271], [97, 147462], [104, 147638], [107, 147818], [110, 147958], [117, 148378], [123, 148558], [129, 149018], [133, 149198], [138, 149378], [144, 149678], [147, 149818], [151, 149938], [154, 150098], [157, 150198]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 151298, "end": 158429, "text": "Y despertó Jacob de su sueño, y dijo: Ciertamente Jehová está en este lugar, y yo no lo sabía.", "words": [[0, 151298], [2, 151423], [11, 152123], [17, 152403], [20, 152823], [23, 153003], [30, 153703], [32, 153783], [38, 154591], [50, 155058], [57, 155558], [62, 155838], [65, 156018], [70, 156198], [77, 156538], [79, 156918], [82, 157098], [85, 157258], [88, 157358]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 158779, "end": 166080, "text": "Y tuvo miedo, y dijo: ¡Cuán terrible es este lugar! No es otra cosa que casa de Dios, y puerta del cielo.", "words": [[0, 158779], [2, 158883], [7, 159103], [14, 159583], [16, 159783], [22, 160563], [28, 160844], [37, 161204], [40, 161684], [45, 161984], [52, 162869], [55, 163006], [58, 163186], [63, 163386], [68, 163746], [72, 163926], [77, 164186], [80, 164386], [86, 164646], [88, 164966], [95, 165326], [99, 165546]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 166430, "end": 176017, "text": "Y se levantó Jacob de mañana, y tomó la piedra que había puesto de cabecera, y la alzó por señal, y derramó aceite encima de ella.", "words": [[0, 166430], [2, 166546], [5, 166666], [13, 167166], [19, 167506], [22, 167806], [30, 168186], [32, 168466], [37, 168826], [40, 168946], [47, 169486], [51, 169626], [57, 169906], [64, 170206], [67, 170486], [77, 171166], [79, 171586], [82, 171766], [87, 172286], [91, 172426], [98, 173086], [100, 173446], [108